  "title": "Create a Shop with Variable Goods [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "商品が可変のショップを作成する【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "abb5a8198956f2fb8e7e06b209e693a4a0b3514db3e2a93be96d4bf862bc873b",
      "translation": "Create a Shop with Variable Goods [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "abb5a8198956f2fb8e7e06b209e693a4a0b3514db3e2a93be96d4bf862bc873b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "商品が可変のショップを作成します。",
      "sourceHash": "e7e12ecf2411235a7913e2ca5584357a55587a6c62c653a6d9784cd79aa43dcc",
      "translation": "Creates a shop with variable goods.",
      "contextHash": "e7e12ecf2411235a7913e2ca5584357a55587a6c62c653a6d9784cd79aa43dcc"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ショップの処理を連結することで、状況に応じて複雑に商品が変化するショップを作成できます。",
      "sourceHash": "5fa0b030bf7fe943ad5e96fa92f273c20363aff332203baf454b59c9e8fd58fe",
      "translation": "By chaining shop processing commands, you can create a shop whose goods change in complex ways depending on the situation.",
      "contextHash": "5fa0b030bf7fe943ad5e96fa92f273c20363aff332203baf454b59c9e8fd58fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上記の画像のようにイベントコマンドを実行してください。",
      "sourceHash": "1794f7f2202307a687b37dae905e3ee6f1afea4fca7385ade6535e1655a7d95a",
      "translation": "Execute the event commands as shown in the image above.",
      "contextHash": "1794f7f2202307a687b37dae905e3ee6f1afea4fca7385ade6535e1655a7d95a"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "商品を設定（プラグインコマンド）",
      "sourceHash": "013baf6b1f5c179ebd681bc26122c055443b18d3d2d69faea48c969e490d5f0a",
      "translation": "Set Goods (Plugin Command)",
      "contextHash": "013baf6b1f5c179ebd681bc26122c055443b18d3d2d69faea48c969e490d5f0a"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "ショップの処理（複数可）",
      "sourceHash": "1e0c4b314f083a95dcd77d2be141c18eb38b83ec0f4aa6b2f3c0f395313fc873",
      "translation": "Shop Processing (Multiple Allowed)",
      "contextHash": "1e0c4b314f083a95dcd77d2be141c18eb38b83ec0f4aa6b2f3c0f395313fc873"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "ショップ開始（プラグインコマンド）",
      "sourceHash": "30ea416acad075675c36d6b6ca225b9a9a5a3b073eb1c79083eb6486b292eb27",
      "translation": "Start Shop (Plugin Command)",
      "contextHash": "30ea416acad075675c36d6b6ca225b9a9a5a3b073eb1c79083eb6486b292eb27"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『商品を設定』の後に『ショップの処理』を複数実行することによって、商品が連結されていきます。",
      "sourceHash": "5935ec927037d38dcd596cdc342b9fa1f02353a3a465afa63282832e55c890ae",
      "translation": "By executing multiple instances of “Shop Processing” after “Set Goods,” the goods are combined.",
      "contextHash": "5935ec927037d38dcd596cdc342b9fa1f02353a3a465afa63282832e55c890ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "条件分岐と組み合わせれば、商品を自由に変更できます。",
      "sourceHash": "c10858c774862ba86f5051a510eb22a4432faa576b0893a687465c258222232d",
      "translation": "By combining this with conditional branches, you can freely change the goods.",
      "contextHash": "c10858c774862ba86f5051a510eb22a4432faa576b0893a687465c258222232d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON in the RPG Maker plugin manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。",
      "sourceHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d",
      "translation": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
      "contextHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
