    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "商品数の変数が機能していない不具合修正。（2024/12/10 ver1.001）",
      "sourceHash": "31798372d1a45c4132fd2e512ffcfbca651a3052ff3de0791a904367f497e882",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where the variable for the number of goods did not function. (2024/12/10 ver1.001)",
      "contextHash": "31798372d1a45c4132fd2e512ffcfbca651a3052ff3de0791a904367f497e882"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-006",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "『商品がないと無視』状態の場合に『商品数の変数』に値が格納されない不具合修正。（2025/02/25 ver1.002）",
      "sourceHash": "bea5dbf7038a61ed8e405687732a58e66b9722731f318819e7822594567fa61a",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where no value was stored in the “Variable Goods Count” when set to “Ignore if No Goods.” (2025/02/25 ver1.002)",
      "contextHash": "bea5dbf7038a61ed8e405687732a58e66b9722731f318819e7822594567fa61a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインコマンド（Plugin Commands）",
      "sourceHash": "4312cefd057cde28f1ea6e48d19e9eb70d06779bb725376f8d8032e94d05e4d2",
      "translation": "Plugin Commands (Plugin Commands)",
      "contextHash": "4312cefd057cde28f1ea6e48d19e9eb70d06779bb725376f8d8032e94d05e4d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "商品を設定（SetGoods）",
      "sourceHash": "2e43c1332a44e2f1b4ebf4cde7a858ea6276b6b27f24ffc2ce6e1c18ba62839a",
      "translation": "Set Goods (SetGoods)",
      "contextHash": "2e43c1332a44e2f1b4ebf4cde7a858ea6276b6b27f24ffc2ce6e1c18ba62839a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグインコマンドの実行後、ショップの処理で設定した商品を連結していきます。",
      "sourceHash": "46ee60c8bca3716b4c64559f3ba64dc3752ec152ba95b57f51c706833bccee1c",
      "translation": "After executing the plugin command, the goods set by Shop Processing are combined.",
      "contextHash": "46ee60c8bca3716b4c64559f3ba64dc3752ec152ba95b57f51c706833bccee1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "次の『ショップ開始』とセットで使用してください。",
      "sourceHash": "c570fbddb027cc6dcb9ebeabe2da023b2e1973829b3ce75a02e27ca72f9acfa6",
      "translation": "Use this together with the following “Start Shop” command.",
      "contextHash": "c570fbddb027cc6dcb9ebeabe2da023b2e1973829b3ce75a02e27ca72f9acfa6"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ショップ開始（StartShop）",
      "sourceHash": "64d54fe418e6b761ccbb614b784ae2bf1c9416a50f8dab384e454bdc822fdf36",
      "translation": "Start Shop (StartShop)",
      "contextHash": "64d54fe418e6b761ccbb614b784ae2bf1c9416a50f8dab384e454bdc822fdf36"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『商品を設定』によって、設定した商品を元にショップ画面を開きます。",
      "sourceHash": "218605c47e727d565e0ddbf4a5ba7d0ea2d926fc6b3f3f13d6b3947d11c0a82a",
      "translation": "Opens the shop screen using the goods set by “Set Goods.”",
      "contextHash": "218605c47e727d565e0ddbf4a5ba7d0ea2d926fc6b3f3f13d6b3947d11c0a82a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "購入のみ（PurchaseOnly）",
      "sourceHash": "87a562b346a88244a9334ddba1d49b494b5701e394d9a926ebd9cf923ad1b94e",
      "translation": "Purchase Only (PurchaseOnly)",
      "contextHash": "87a562b346a88244a9334ddba1d49b494b5701e394d9a926ebd9cf923ad1b94e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ショップを購入のみに限定します。",
      "sourceHash": "99fd86e10cb68c7a09ec411d99e8fab103c3e9d879518709a1a9d0a9d04cde70",
      "translation": "Limits the shop to purchases only.",
      "contextHash": "99fd86e10cb68c7a09ec411d99e8fab103c3e9d879518709a1a9d0a9d04cde70"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "商品数の変数（VariableGoodsCount）",
      "sourceHash": "12af5c8d806460bb1958e5a83dc854267e18a20a3e93d36f12891a3f8c4648aa",
      "translation": "Variable Goods Count (VariableGoodsCount)",
      "contextHash": "12af5c8d806460bb1958e5a83dc854267e18a20a3e93d36f12891a3f8c4648aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "最終的な商品数を指定した変数に格納します。",
      "sourceHash": "0b0dc8de53cf7415a5d1eb121ec7a3e59257ffccfa4ec4d3d1efde844651a451",
      "translation": "Stores the final number of goods in the specified variable.",
      "contextHash": "0b0dc8de53cf7415a5d1eb121ec7a3e59257ffccfa4ec4d3d1efde844651a451"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータの『商品がないと無視』と組み合わせれば、商品が存在しない場合の分岐を作成できます。",
      "sourceHash": "cb16895437327dbc37b6c8b016db67f615a65f838a4cb3323908d399fd7305f8",
      "translation": "When combined with the plugin parameter “Ignore if No Goods,” you can create a branch for when no goods exist.",
      "contextHash": "cb16895437327dbc37b6c8b016db67f615a65f838a4cb3323908d399fd7305f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "商品がないと無視（IgnoreNoGoods）",
      "sourceHash": "4a4257a090398982f4c229d3634c1efeeef849a0f1896dacfda19c258df0f1d2",
      "translation": "Ignore if No Goods (IgnoreNoGoods)",
      "contextHash": "4a4257a090398982f4c229d3634c1efeeef849a0f1896dacfda19c258df0f1d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "商品が存在しない場合はショップ開始を無視します。",
      "sourceHash": "618e2a4051d5e8c771642f21cdf8d7ddf2ce290c7ac737d36d6c4a4f18bc2775",
      "translation": "Ignores Start Shop when no goods exist.",
      "contextHash": "618e2a4051d5e8c771642f21cdf8d7ddf2ce290c7ac737d36d6c4a4f18bc2775"
    }
  ],
